"settings.memory.hint" = "Memory is created by the first prompt sent in a project; a project no prompt was sent in is not touched. Its documents, manifests and commit subjects are then read a part at a time by the lightest model. From finished tasks only decisions, mistakes and lessons are kept, not chat text; a compact task note remains available for later recall. Findings stay on this Mac and are handed to the model with related requests; as they pile up, the ones saying the same thing are merged, a superseded one is dropped and what has not changed stays. With the scan off no model is called in the background; task notes and learning from feedback go on, findings and merging wait.";
